<title>UK: Cariplo sets 600 billion lire zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Cariplo sets 600 billion lire zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Cariplo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CARIPLO SPA LONDON</p>
<p> AMT    600 BLN LIRE  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY   *04.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  29.915    PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL ON 04.NOV.03 AT 49.635</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 10-50-100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> NOTES	UNSECURED, UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
